The Rule-Based Reasoning Agent applies statutory logic to evaluate options, interpret regulations, and test outcomes against legal norms. It encodes the decision rules from the IBC, Companies Act, and procedural regulations into a structured framework, enabling consistent, rule-compliant reasoning. This ensures that every recommendation or clause suggested during settlement aligns with applicable law.";}s:8:"relation";a:1:{s:10:"firstimage";s:0:"";}s:5:"title";N;s:11:"last_change";a:4:{s:4:"date";N;s:4:"user";N;s:2:"ip";N;s:3:"sum";N;}}s:10:"persistent";a:3:{s:4:"date";a:1:{s:7:"created";i:1761649199;}s:4:"user";s:0:"";s:7:"creator";s:0:"";}}